{"html":"\n\t<div><div>\n\n<div>\n\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<hgroup>\n\n\t\t<h2 id=\"section-1\">Dermaplane + Hydrating Treatment with Red Light Therapy</h2>\n\t\t\t</hgroup>\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Dermaplaning</strong> removes dead skin cells and peach fuzz, followed by <strong>medical-grade hydration</strong> to soften and plump, <strong>red light therapy</strong> to stimulate collagen and kick renewal into gear, and a warm hand massage with heated mitts to finish. It’s a full sensory experience – the kind of treatment you’re going to want to rave about!</p>\n<p>Enjoy this treatment for only $125 or a package of 3 for $290.</p>\n<p><strong>Call <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a> or <a href=\"#/new-services-specials/?section=form\">fill out the form to schedule and claim your savings</a>.</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"media/dcbfdad9ecd8-AEOS_NewService_DermaplaneHydrateRedLight-license-confirmed.jpg\" alt=\"Two close-up photos of people receiving a facial treatment while wearing protective eye coverings.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\">\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div><div>\n\n<div>\n\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"media/d62883c9a87a-AEOS_NewService_HydrafacialAcneTreatment-license-confirmed.jpg\" alt=\"Two close-up photos of people receiving a facial treatment while wearing protective eye coverings.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\">\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<hgroup>\n\n\t\t<h2 id=\"section-2\">HydraFacial® Customized for Acne only $150</h2>\n\t\t\t</hgroup>\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>HydraFacial</strong> deeply cleanses, extracts, and hydrates. Designed for acne-prone skin, this treatment combines <strong>HydraFacial</strong> with <strong>Blue Light Therapy</strong> to reduce breakouts, clear congestion, reduce inflammation, and minimize pores for clearer, calmer, skin.</p>\n<p>Enjoy this treatment for just $150.</p>\n<p><strong>Call <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a> or <a href=\"#/new-services-specials/?section=form\">fill out the form to schedule and claim your savings</a>.</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div id=\"form\"><div>\n\n<div>\n\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<hgroup>\n\n\t\t<h2 id=\"section-3\">New Services Specials</h2>\n\t\t\t</hgroup>\n\t\t\t\t<p><iframe id=\"inline-yZkor0Arjxd6Z9s8q1Tm\" data-layout=\"{'id':'INLINE'}\" data-trigger-type=\"alwaysShow\" data-trigger-value=\"\" data-activation-type=\"alwaysActivated\" data-activation-value=\"\" data-deactivation-type=\"neverDeactivate\" data-deactivation-value=\"\" data-form-name=\"New Services\" data-height=\"undefined\" data-layout-iframe-id=\"inline-yZkor0Arjxd6Z9s8q1Tm\" data-form-id=\"yZkor0Arjxd6Z9s8q1Tm\" src=\"https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/form/yZkor0Arjxd6Z9s8q1Tm\" title=\"New Services\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"source-survey\"><br />\n</iframe><br>\n</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"media/d184f7c0b0f9-AdobeStock-435909889-medium.jpg\" alt=\"Young Asian woman with clean healthy glowing skin in white top isolated on beige background. Facial skin care concept, spa, cosmetology, plastic surgery.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\">\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div></div></div>"}